# ---- FloodRiverine/ is its own git repository -----------------------------
# It has its own remote (AbyThankachan3/riverineflooding) and holds the three
# superseded legacy scripts. Tracking it here would add it as an empty gitlink,
# so it is excluded. Its contents are unchanged on disk and still versioned in
# that repo. FloodCoastal/ is NOT a repo, so its legacy scripts ARE included
# here for reference.
FloodRiverine/
